OL,3,GNEWSARape and child sexual abuse
OL,4,Aarrests in church investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo arrests as part of an investigation
OL,7,Finto safeguarding concerns at the
OL,8,FPresbyterian Church in Ireland, were in
OL,9,Frelation to sexual communication with a
OL,10,Fchild and rape.
OL,12,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,13,F(PSNI) said 168 people had now
OL,14,Fcontacted police directly to report
OL,15,Fconcerns, compared to 127 which was
OL,16,Freported on 4 September.
OL,18,FTheir investigation into the church was
OL,19,Fannounced in November last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
